   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Whitaker Peace and Development Initiative (WPDI) - Quality Block Making Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Name: Quality Block Making Project.Location: Gurei, Juba, South Sudan.Summary: Yanga and Friends Enterprise seeks to produce quality blocks using modernized block making machines. Their aim is to fill the gap in the block making business in order to meet the increasing demand for quality blocks in Gurei, in the western part of Juba, South Sudan.</narrative>
